---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About NameVerse — Our Mission & Editorial Standards"
  description="NameVerse helps parents find meaningful baby names across Islamic, Hindu, Christian and global traditions. Learn about our mission, data and editorial standards."
>
  <div class="container-page py-10 sm:py-14">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
      <header class="mb-8">
        <span class="eyebrow">About us</span>
        <h1 class="mt-2 font-display text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-nv-text sm:text-4xl">
          About NameVerse
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-nv-text-secondary">
          NameVerse exists to make one of life's most personal decisions — naming a child — easier,
          more informed and more respectful of culture and faith.
        </p>
      </header>

      <div class="space-y-5">
        <section class="card p-6 sm:p-8">
          <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-nv-text">Our mission</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-nv-text-secondary">
            A name carries meaning, heritage and identity. We built NameVerse so parents can search
            42,000+ names across Islamic, Hindu, Christian and Italian traditions with verified
            meanings, origins, pronunciation guidance and cultural context — all in one fast,
            free, mobile-friendly place.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="card p-6 sm:p-8">
          <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-nv-text">What makes us different</h2>
          <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-nv-text-secondary">
            <li class="flex gap-2.5">
              <span class="mt-0.5 text-nv-success">&#10003;</span>
              Verified meanings with linguistic and cultural context, not one-line glosses.
            </li>
            <li class="flex gap-2.5">
              <span class="mt-0.5 text-nv-success">&#10003;</span>
              Multi-tradition coverage: Arabic, Urdu, Persian, Sanskrit, Hebrew, Greek, Latin and more.
            </li>
            <li class="flex gap-2.5">
              <span class="mt-0.5 text-nv-success">&#10003;</span>
              Rich name profiles: lucky numbers, numerology, pronunciation, variations and related names.
            </li>
            <li class="flex gap-2.5">
              <span class="mt-0.5 text-nv-success">&#10003;</span>
              No accounts, no paywalls — search and browsing are free for every family.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="card p-6 sm:p-8">
          <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-nv-text">Editorial standards</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-nv-text-secondary">
            Entries are reviewed for linguistic origin, common usage and faith-aware interpretation
            before they appear in search results and curated lists. When traditions differ on a
            meaning or pronunciation, we note the variation rather than picking a side. If you spot
            an error, tell us via the <a href="/contact" class="font-semibold text-nv-accent hover:underline">contact page</a> —
            corrections are prioritized.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="card p-6 sm:p-8">
          <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-nv-text">Where to start</h2>
          <div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
            <a href="/names" class="btn-primary">Browse all names</a>
            <a href="/search" class="btn-ghost">Search by meaning</a>
            <a href="/blog" class="btn-ghost">Read our guides</a>
          </div>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
